Feil: (*He looks out the nearest window and sees a growing shade of orange in the night sky*)
Feil: “...you’ve probably heard me say the same thing before.”
Feil: (*He picks up his mug and takes a deep sip of his hot beverage*)
Player: (*You’re thinking he’s going to start talking about some deep shit*)
Feil: (*He quickly turns and meets you’re gaze, he’s got a huge grin on his face*)
Feil: (*Super high pitch*) “BUT YOU KNOW WHAT NEVER GETS OLD!”
Feil: (*Calmly*) “Black holes.”
Player: (*You’re wondering what the hell is in his mug*)
Feil: (*Back to normal seemingly*) “They’re these cosmic vacuums that don’t actually suck things up like they do in TV fiction. Black holes essentially warp spacetime itself.
Feil: “Space flows inward just like a waterfall, and the crazy part is that even light can't climb back out!”
Feil: (*Excitedly*) “Isn’t that just wild!?”
Feil: (*He leans in weirdly close… you can feel his breath hit your face*)
Feil: (*His breath smells like dirt and something fermented*)
Feil: “Would you… wanna know more about that?”
->(*Starting to feel moderately concerned, voice is a little shaky*) “Of course black holes sound cool Feil. I would love to know more…”
    Feil: (*His pupils dilate to the max*)
    Feil: “Yes, I knew you’d understand! That curiosity is what our cosmos craves!”
    Feil: (*He sets his mug down gently, his hands trembling*)
    Feil: “You can clearly see… it’s all connected!”
    Feil: “Stars die, collapse, becoming black holes… that might not be the end but a new beginning.”
    Feil: “Maybe love is the same way… It can pull you in, break you down, but it’s all just the start of something larger.”
    <<set $affection +=1>>
->(*Dead serious*) “Not really, I think you should calm down.”
    Feil: (eyes widen slightly; he straightens his posture and fixes his imaginary bow tie*) 
    Feil: “Ahhh. Yes, you’re right I appear to be functioning on a new level right now.”
    Feil: (*His eyes lock onto his mug for two whole minutes*)
    Feil: (*He locks back in*) “I’ll write down a reminder to switch to decaf nebula roast.”
    Feil: (*He starts writing on a post-it, then slaps it down on his desk*)
    Player: (*You look at the post-it, and it only has two words written on it*)
    Player: (*It reads: BING BONG*)
    Player: (*You become a little more concerned about Feil’s well-being and are wondering what the hell is in the nebula roast*)
->“You know, black holes take things in because the matter just follows the curvature of spacetime.”
    Feil: (*Coldly*) “What the hell are you trying to do right now!?”
    Player: (*Timidly*) “What… I was just trying too…”
    Feil: (*He proceed to put his face right up against yours*)
    Feil: (*Sternly*) “I’m the science guy here, pal!”
    Feil: (*Sternly*) “And if you ever try some shit like that again… there’ll be hell to pay!
    Feil: (*Calmly*) “Now look me in the eyes and apologize."
    Player: (*You see that Feil’s pupils are now fully dilated.)
    Player: (*Petrified*) “Sorry sir…”
    Feil: (*Feil backs up and gives you your space back finally*)
    Feil: Apology accepted, let’s move on.
    <<set $affection -=1>>

Player: (*You finally come to the realization that Feil’s mug contains some sort of hallucinogenic drug*)
Player: “Hey, Feil…”
Player: “Buddy, what’s in the mug?”
Feil: “You know… we’ve talked a lot about the universe, the stars, gravity, and all that stuff that’s supposed to make us feel small.”
Player: (*Feil just completely ignored what you said*)
Feil: (*Feil chuckles softly, then looks down at himself, flexing slightly.)
Feil: "However, as of late... I've been giving less consideration to the universe..."
Feil: (He looks at you with a worried but genuine expression) "...and more about the gravitational pull between us."
Feil: "So, how do you feel about me in the expanse of the universe?"

<<if $affection >6>>
Player: “You’re everything I’ve been looking Feil, let me have some of the “coffee” from your mug and let’s go on a cosmic adventure!”
<<Animate RTHappy>>
Feil: (*Smiling brightly*) I’d thought you’d never ask!
<<Animate RTKiss>>
Feil: (*He gives you a sip, and a kiss! Congrats you romanced Feil the GrassWrightThumb*)
<<else>>
Player: (*Sullenly*) “Look Feil, you're a very knowledgeable guy… but I don’t see an us.”
Feil: (*His bright and vibrant face turns blue*) “Oh…”
<<Animate RTSad>>
Feil: (*Tears in his eyes*) “No cosmic connection here… *sniffle* not mutual. These things happen.”
Feil: (He looks back out the window, the orange glow reflecting in his eyes)
Feil: Guess I’ll have to look else where in this vast universe…
<<endif>>
<<StopAnimation>>
<<jump Menu>>
